  3. review/edit · refuses the input 409 · when namesPlanCommentsWithoutTheEdit · "a comment on the plan goes with your edit"

approve · owned by review · sent by reviewer
  1. review/held · asks to confirm 409 · while held · "The review is held: <hold>."
  2. review/no-version · refuses 409 · when noVersionUnderReview · "no version is under review yet"
  3. review/approve-stale · refuses the input 409 · when editsAnotherVersion · "v2 is under review, not v1"
  4. review/approve-draft · refuses 409 · when planChangedSinceTheVersion · "plan.md changed since v1: record it before approving"

planWritten · owned by review · sent by claude · passes a hold
  no row

